imately connected to the translation of concepts, ideas and movements and how they have been transplanted into and out of English and Chinese.", "title": "Translation and the Environment", "levelOfInstruction": "undergraduate", "prerequisitesText": "<p>ECTB58H3 or ECTB61H3</p>", "corequisitesText": null, "exclusionsText": null, "recommendedPreparation": "<p>Recommended preparation: high level of proficiency in both Chinese and English</p>", "note": null, "division": "University of Toronto Scarborough", "breadthRequirements": ["Arts, Literature & Language"], "distributionRequirements": null, "publicationSections": ["Languages"], "cmPublicationSections": [{"section": "Languages", "subSections": null}]}, "created": "2026-04-21@23:18:44.844", "modified": null, "lastSaved": 0, "primaryTeachMethod": "LEC", "faculty": {"code": "SCAR", "name": "University of Toronto Scarborough"}, "coSec": {"code": "", "name": null}, "department": {"code": "CFLSC", "name": "Department of Language Studies (UTSC)"}, "title": null, "maxCredit": 0.5, "minCredit": 0.5, "breadths": [{"org": {"code": "SCAR", "name": "University of Toronto Scarborough"}, "breadthTypes": [{"kind": "BREADTH", "type": "Arts Lit & Lang", "description": "Arts, Literature & Language", "code": "Arts"}]}], "notes": [{"name": "Course Note", "type": "COURSE", "content": ""}], "cancelInd": "", "subscriptionTtb": false, "subscriptionOpenData": false, "tb1Active": false, "tb2Active": false, "fullyOnline": false, "primaryFull": false, "primaryWaitlistable": false}, {"id": "697d239c20609159511a6a26", "name": "Translation and Adaptation", "ucName": null, "code": "ECTD66H3", "sectionCode": "F", "campus": "Scarborough", "sessions": ["20265F"], "sections": [{"name": "LEC01", "type": "Lecture", "teachMethod": "LEC", "sectionNumber": "01", "meetingTimes": [], "firstMeeting": null, "instructors": [{"firstName": "Ting", "lastName": "Guo"}], "currentEnrolment": 26, "maxEnrolment": 26, "subTitle": "", "cancelInd": "N", "waitlistInd": "Y", 